hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"973","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba mein se aadmiyon ko Lailat-ul-Qadr aakhri saat (raaton) mein khwaab mein dikhaai gai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main dekhta hun ke tumharey khwaab aakhri saat mein mutafiq huey hain. Phir jo usey talaash karney wala ho to use aakhri saat mein talaash karna chaahiye. (Bukhari: 2015)"
"974","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Ramazan key darmiyaani ashra mein etekaaf kya. To Aap bees ki subah nikley aur hamein khutba diya aur farmaya: Beshak mujhey Lailat-ul-Qadr dikhaai gai thi, phir mujhey bhula di gai ya main bhula diya gaya. To use aakhri ashra mein taaq (raaton) mein talaash karo. Aur beshak main ne dekha ke main paani aur mitti mein sajda kar raha hun. Phir jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath motakif tha wo wapas aaey. To ham wapas aey jabke ham aasmaan mein baadal ka tukda na dekhtey they. To baadal aaya aur baarish barsaai yahan tak ke masjid ki chhat behnein lagi jabke wo khajoor ki shaakhon ki thi. Aur namaz key liye iqaamat kahi gai. To main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko paani aur mitti mein sajda kartey huey dekha yahan tak ke main ne Aapki peshaani mein mitti ka nishaan dekha. (Bukhari: 2016)"
"975","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use Ramazan key aakhri ashra mein talaash karo, Lailat-ul-Qadr ko, nawein mein jo baaqi rehti hai, saatwein mein jo baaqi rehti hai, paanchwein mein jo baaqi rehti hai. (Bukhari: 2021)"
"976","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wo aakhri ashra mein hai. Wo nau mein hai jo guzar jaatein hain ya saat mein jo baaqi rehti hain. Yaani Lailat-ul-Qadr. (Bukhari: 2022)"
"977","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab ashra daakhil hota to apna tehband kas letey aur apni raat zinda kartey aur apne ghar walon ko jagaatey. (Bukhari: 2024). Etekaf ki kitaab."
